        FOR EACH PRODUCT (ANGULAR DISTRIBUTIONS ARE GIVEN ONLY    2431 1451
        FOR THE OUTGOING NEUTRON; ISOTROPY IS ASSUMED FOR THE     2431 1451
        ALPHA AND RESIDUAL).  (N,XA) D-D EMISSION DATA HEAVILY    2431 1451
        USED TO BENCHMARK THE CALCULATIONS [He87].                2431 1451
