        NEUTRON AND 51V RESIDUAL, AND ENERGY DEPENDENT YIELD      2431 1451
        BASED ON TNG CALCULATED GAMMA-RAY SPECTRA FOR THE GAMMA   2431 1451
        RAY; CALCULATED NORMALIZED DISTRIBUTIONS ARE GIVEN FOR    2431 1451
        EACH PRODUCT (ANGULAR DISTRIBUTIONS ARE GIVEN ONLY FOR    2431 1451
        THE OUTGOING NEUTRON).  (N,XP) D-D EMISSION DATA HEAVILY  2431 1451
        USED TO BENCHMARK THE CALCULATIONS [He87].                2431 1451
