           BASED ON DATA AND CALCULATION UNCERTAINTIES.           2431 1451
 33-102 UNCERTAINTIES ARE EXPLICIT, BASED ON THERMAL DATA AT LOW  2431 1451
        ENERGIES, AND CALCULATED RESULTS ABOVE 980 KEV.           2431 1451
 33-103 UNCERTAINTIES ESTIMATED FROM TNG.                         2431 1451
